.SH NAME
le-watch-all - Live feed of listeners appearing (+) and disappearing (-)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle watch-all [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Poll the listener set and print every appearance and disappearance as
it happens — a 'what just started/stopped' feed. Ctrl-C to stop.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for watch-all

.PP
\fB-i\fP, \fB--interval\fP=2s
	how often to poll (e.g. 5s)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBle(1)\fP


